			<div class="content" id="post-content-2674104">
									

<p>Hey! Okami here, and I'd just like to say first thanks for all the support and help along the way of the creation of this SCP! I would've liked to say I did it all on my own, but I am no liar and I give credit where credit is due. If not for Zyn's help with the format and clinical tone, I believe that I would've never finished and probably given up eventually. She also helped with making this more reasonable as well as get all the feedback we needed to get it to where it is now. As a result, I think she deserves more than enough to become co-author of this author. In the end, I'm happy to see my first SCP become a reality, and with it's original idea entirely intact as well! Again, thanks to everyone who helped, reviewed, or even commented on the idea post!</p>
<p>Team:<br />
-Zyn</p>
<p>Reviewers:<br />
Initial: Kabersch, Boogey_Man23, DreadLindwyrm, Doctor Cimmerian, MobRules, KoriZero, MrWrong, Scorpion451</p>
<p>First pass in chat: Jekeled, Wogglebug</p>
<p>Second pass in chat: minmin, Lazar, Conwell, Nusquam, LadyKatie, Decibelle, Vacuum, AbsentmindedNihilist, SpectralDragon, Lex1nat0r</p>

